<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Fig. 5: </span>Analysis of average gate activation over 2k examples from the InfoSeek and Encyclopedic-VQA test split of the M2KR benchmark.</figcaption>
