<span id="tab1.1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="tab1.1.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Davide Caffagni</span>  received the M.Sc. degree in Computer Engineering cum laude from the University of Modena and Reggio Emilia in 2023. He is currently pursuing a PhD in Information and Communication Technologies (ICT) at the University of Modena and Reggio Emilia. His research topics include Computer Vision and Natural Language Processing, with a focus on image captioning, multimodal large language models, and multimodal retrieval.</span>
</span></td></tr>
