<span id="A2.F7.1.1.6.3.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.F7.1.1.6.3.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">[…] as the Gregorian telescope. <span id="A2.F7.1.1.6.3.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Isaac Newton</span> has been generally credited with building the first reflecting telescope in 1668.</span></span>
</span></td>
